      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "经比原定计划多浇灌了$800$米$^3$．水电站的建设者$10$",
        "天共浇灌了多少立方米的混凝土？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "956",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "956．为了按期完成播种任务，集体农庄必须每天播种$73$公",
        "顷．庄员们超额完成了计划，每天多播种$14$公顷．到",
        "最后两天，只剩下了$6$公顷需要播种．集体农庄共需播",
        "种多少公顷地？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第48小节"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "957",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "957．求值：",
        "а) $5cx+x^2$，当$x=0.17$，$c=11.5$时；",
        "б) $4a^2-ab$，当$a=1.47$，$b=5.78$时．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "958",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "958．用适当的二项式替换字母$M$，使下列各式成为恒等式：",
        "а) $5x(-a-b)=-5x\\cdot M$；",
        "б) $3y(2-2c)=-6y\\cdot M$；",
        "в) $-p(c-p)=p\\cdot M$；",
        "г) $-a(-a^2+7a)=a^2\\cdot M$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "959",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "959．化成积的形式（$n\\in N$）：",
        "а) $x^n+x$，其中$n>1$；",
        "б) $y^{n+5}-y^6$，其中$n>1$；",
        "в) $a^{n-1}+a^{15}$，其中$1<n<15$；",
        "г) $b^{20}-b^{n+2}$，其中$n<18$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "960",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "960．证明：",
        "а) $7^{10}-7^9-7^8$，能被$41$整除；",
        "б) $10^9+10^8+10^7$，能被$222$整除；",
        "в) $25^7-5^{12}$，能被$120$整除；",
        "г) $81^7-27^9-9^{13}$能被$45$整除；",
        "д) $45^{45}\\cdot15^{15}$能被$75^{30}$整除；"
      ]
    },
